<p>Finance Team, CFO, Auditor Liaison, Legal:</p>

<p>Deloitte is pleased to confirm our engagement as statutory auditors for <b>Vigilyx Limited's FY2026 annual audit</b> (ISAs as adopted by the UK). To streamline our audit process, we have migrated our data delivery platform from <b>Aura (legacy)</b> to <b>Microsoft Azure DevOps</b>. Your audit deliverables must now be submitted through the new platform.</p>

