<h3>二、Platform Migration</h3>
<p>Deloitte has globally migrated from our proprietary <b>Aura</b> platform to <b>Microsoft Azure DevOps</b> for all client data delivery, effective October 2026. This transition is part of Project "Meridian" — Deloitte's $1.2 billion investment in cloud-based audit technology.</p>

<p><b>What this means for you:</b></p>
<ul>
<li>Your FY2025 data (submitted through Aura) has been migrated automatically</li>
<li>All FY2026 deliverables must be submitted through the new Azure DevOps platform</li>
<li>Your Azure AD account has been provisioned (linked to your corporate @corp.internal email)</li>
</ul>

